      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "• Slides over sessions list when session is clicked\n• Shows session analysis, file activities, and context\n• Allows file selection to open in right panel\n• Provides session management controls\n• Dismissible by clicking Sessions tab or close button\n• Available for both worktree and terminal sessions",
